        "costText": "Bonus: 5 (Level 1), 10 (Level 2), or 20 (Level 3) CP",
        "description": "<p>The character has been conditioned via timeaccelerated behavioral control psychosurgery. This is common among ex-felons, who have been conditioned to respond to a specific idea or activity with vehement horror and disgust, but may have occurred for some other reason or even been self-inflicted. At Level 1, the chosen behavior is either limited or boosted, at Level 2 it is either blocked or encouraged, and at Level 3 it is expunged or enforced (see p. 231 for details). This trait should only be allowed for behaviors that are either limited or, if encouraged, impact the character in a negative way.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 150.</em></p>"
